[24/06, 1:27 pm] Rajesh Netsuite Bro: Project Description:
This project involves integrating Parcel Pro, a secure logistics and shipping platform, with NetSuite ERP using Celigo Integrator.io to streamline shipment tracking and fulfillment processes. The integration leverages Parcel Pro's REST APIs to pull real-time shipping details and push them into NetSuite's Sales Orders, Item Fulfillments, and Tracking Information records.
Objective:
To automate the data exchange between Parcel Pro and NetSuite, eliminate manual entry of tracking details, improve shipment visibility, and ensure timely updates of fulfillment records in NetSuite.
Scope
    ◦    Pull tracking numbers, shipping carrier, and status from Parcel Pro.
    ◦    Update NetSuite Item Fulfillment records with real-time tracking data.
